# The champion, one knob from compounding: income_ladder on cover-off.
#
# The one lever class measured positive anywhere that remains untested
# post-certification: the retimed extractorT3 withhold took 4/6 first-ever
# wins on never-won VH seeds pre-certification (log 2026-07-31), and the
# Impossible mechanism is exactly compounding income (3.7x, log 2026-08-07).
# Masonry lost twice at this rung; this answers compounding with compounding.
# flame-nocover one field apart: income_ladder 1.


